# Allowlist: only what the build actually needs goes into the Docker build context.
# This keeps real financial data (my-real-plan.json, retirement_model.xlsx, PLAN.md)
# out of any image that gets pushed to a registry.
*
!index.html
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig*.json
!vite.config.ts
!public
!src
!nginx.conf
